WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Do you want Chicago police not to help ICE agents?

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.560
Our police department will respond

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.360
to every incident in which their services are

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.540
needed to keep people safe, protecting

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:13.800
the fundamental right to be able to protest,

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.040
ensuring the maximum safety of our residents.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:20.879
Johnson's signaling that the police's priority

00:00:20.879 --> 00:00:24.639
is protecting protesters above everyone else.

00:00:24.639 --> 00:00:28.160
Agents are getting attacked with cars, projectiles,

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.639
and being shot at across the country.

00:00:30.639 --> 00:00:34.560
But Governor Ribs is declaring war on ICE.

